\p{Counts of one load (\code{\verb~|-X stop-after=load~}, three loads per process, the process's count divided by three), and of the loader thread alone inside the pipelined pass with 8 workers (the counters of that one thread, attached after the first pass of a process; per pass); \code{\verb~|perf stat~} in the arena container, base and candidate alternating, the median of the rounds. The cycles of a round depend on what else the host does, so only the two columns of one row are compared:}

\table{
\tr{\th{the executable, base -> candidate}\th{Init}\th{cslib}\th{navier-stokes-euler}\th{Mathlib}}
